OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start for many with
OL,6,Fshowery outbreaks of rain. Bright
OL,7,Fspells developing at times through the
OL,8,Fday. Feeling warm and humid in the
OL,9,Fsouth, but fresher in the north as it
OL,10,Fturns windy with heavy rain later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will move
OL,13,Facross the north and west tonight.
OL,14,FDrier in the south and east with
OL,15,Fcloudy skies and staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
