OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FShowery outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fmove south across England and Wales.
OL,7,FSunshine and showers in the north.
OL,8,FHumid in the south at first, but
OL,9,Fturning fresher for everyone by the
OL,10,Fevening.
